name: "phighthouse"
displayName: "PHIGHTHOUSE!"
description: '''
PHIGHTHOUSE! is a style i made up which is basically a combination of phighting, a 5v5 fighting game by boggio, and whitehouse, a british extreme music band started by w. bennett.
this mod was originally made as "a mod within a mod" but it's has been decided to be it's own thing.
(note: this mod was partally inspired by another mod, some buildings from that mod were flipped to fit the phighthouse image, credits to them.)
'''
